  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "band_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -394
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Generative band\n\nA self-playing trio, heard and seen. The clock is the time itself: each eighth note is one step, thirty seconds divided by the tempo long (the Step clock subpatch). Melody: noise walks a pentatonic scale (Degree of a step, then Lookup into a list of intervals), a random number per step decides which steps rest, and a MonoSynth plays the rest through a Delay and a Reverb. Bass: a sawtooth on the chord of the bar (a Switch, four bars round), shaped by an Envelope and a Filter. Hats: filtered noise on every step. Three Outputs sum into the speakers.\n\nThe picture uses the same numbers: the ring of 16 steps (lit: notes, dim: rests), a burst for each note coloured by its pitch, and the melody's FFT spectrum round the centre and waveform along the bottom, all through Echo trails and bloom.\n\n• Sliders: `bpm`, `density` (how few rests), `volume`.  • Toggle: major / minor.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 330
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Generative band\n\nA self-playing trio, heard and seen. The clock is the time itself: each eighth note is one step, thirty seconds divided by the tempo long (the Step clock subpatch). Melody: noise walks a pentatonic scale (Degree of a step, then Lookup into a list of intervals), a random number per step decides which steps rest, and a MonoSynth plays the rest through a Delay and a Reverb. Bass: a sawtooth on the chord of the bar (a Switch, four bars round), shaped by an Envelope and a Filter. Hats: filtered noise on every step. Three Outputs sum into the speakers.\n\nThe picture uses the same numbers: the ring of 16 steps (lit: notes, dim: rests), a burst for each note coloured by its pitch, and the melody's FFT spectrum round the centre and waveform along the bottom, all through Echo trails and bloom.\n\n• Sliders: `bpm`, `density` (how few rests), `volume`.  • Toggle: major / minor.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 330
      }
    },
